        "text": "967. 计算：\n1) $\\frac{19}{20}-\\left(\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{2}{5}\\right)$；\n2) $\\frac{1}{30}+\\left(\\frac{3}{5}-\\frac{1}{6}\\right)$."
